@title Punch list PDF and STEP cabinet model written and kept for inspection
@area Reports
# The door cut-out fixture has an enclosure with a mounting plate and door cut-outs: Ctrl+K "Export punch list" and "Export the cabinet as STEP" write the files next to the project copy; keep_file copies them.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Export punch list
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
expect_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/door-cutouts punch list.pdf" 1500
keep_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/door-cutouts punch list.pdf"
shot punch-list
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Export the cabinet as STEP
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
expect_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/door-cutouts*.stp" 2000
keep_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/door-cutouts*.stp"
shot step
